      "description": "<p>You gain a <strong>deck</strong>, a <strong>hand</strong> and a <strong>discard pile</strong> (see Unique Mechanic).</p>\n<p>During a conflict, you may <strong>use an action</strong> and spend up to <strong>[10 + (SL × 5)]</strong> Mind Points (minimum 10). If you do, <strong>resolve 1 card from your hand for every 5 MP</strong> spent this way (to a maximum of <strong>5</strong> cards; these cards form a <strong>set</strong>). After you resolve the effect of the set (if any), <strong>discard</strong> these cards and <strong>draw</strong> that many cards from your deck.</p>\n<details style=\"border:2px solid #b3002d; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin-top:10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"cursor:pointer; background:#b3002d; color:#fff; padding:8px 12px; font-weight:700; font-family:Signika, sans-serif; letter-spacing:.3px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><strong>♠ ♥ ♦ ♣ Card Set Effects (click to expand)</strong></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"tableWrapper\" style=\"background:#fff;\">\n        <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; text-align:left;\">\n            <tbody><tr style=\"background:#b3002d; color:#fff;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding:6px; border-right:1px solid #a00027;\">\n                        <p><strong>Effect</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:6px; border-right:1px solid #a00027;\">\n                        <p><strong>Set Requirements</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:6px;\">\n                        <p><strong>Resolve</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background:#fff5f7; border-bottom:2px solid #b3002d; padding:8px;\">\n                        <p style=\"margin: 0\"><em>Note:</em> <strong>Blinding Flush</strong>, <strong>Double Trouble</strong>, and <strong>Magic Flush</strong> deal <strong>+10</strong> extra damage if you are <strong>level 20+</strong>, or <strong>+20</strong> if you are <strong>level 40+</strong>.</p>\n                        <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0\">If you use a classic poker deck, the recommended suit types are: <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(168, 255, 187) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Air</span></strong></a></span></span> (♦), <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-id=\"ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(210, 180, 140) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Earth</span></strong></a></span></span> (♣), <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-id=\"0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(255, 174, 0) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Fire</span></strong></a></span></span> (♥), and <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(166, 227, 255) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Ice</span></strong></a></span></span> (♠).</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Jackpot</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>4 cards of the same value, none is a joker</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>You and every ally present on the scene recover <strong>777</strong> Hit Points and <strong>777</strong> Mind Points; any PCs who have <strong>surrendered</strong> but are still part of the scene immediately regain consciousness (this does not cancel the effects of their Surrender).</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Magic Flush</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>4 cards of consecutive values and of the same suit</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>Deal damage equal to <strong>[25 + the total value of the resolved cards]</strong> to each enemy present on the scene; the type of this damage matches the <strong>suit</strong> of the resolved cards.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Blinding Flush</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>4 cards of consecutive values</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>Deal damage equal to <strong>[15 + the total value of the resolved cards]</strong> to each enemy present on the scene; the type of this damage is <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.IQaK3IzvfFp4I1xB\" data-id=\"IQaK3IzvfFp4I1xB\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(202, 189, 154) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Light</span></strong></a></span></span> if the highest value among those cards is even, or <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-id=\"vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(182, 102, 210) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Dark</span></strong></a></span></span> if that value is odd.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Full Status</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>3 cards of the same value + 2 cards of the same value</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>Choose two status effects among <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.3nmUvPei3zrOJkEt\" data-id=\"3nmUvPei3zrOJkEt\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Dazed</span></strong></a></span></span>, <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.ImFKpNNGjstom7Q9\" data-id=\"ImFKpNNGjstom7Q9\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Shaken</span></strong></a></span></span>, <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.HHmYmj7xffQMqtzT\" data-id=\"HHmYmj7xffQMqtzT\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Slow</span></strong></a></span></span>, and <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.KYehgac3Pw1fKC9S\" data-id=\"KYehgac3Pw1fKC9S\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Weak</span></strong></a></span></span>. If the highest value among the resolved cards is even, you and every ally present on the scene recover from the chosen status effects; if odd, each enemy present on the scene suffers them.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Triple Support</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>3 cards of the same value</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>You and every ally present on the scene regain an amount of Hit Points and Mind Points equal to <strong>[the total value of the resolved cards × 3]</strong>.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p><strong>Double Trouble</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>2 cards of the same value + 2 cards of the same value</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e9d6da;\">\n                        <p>Deal damage equal to <strong>[10 + the highest value among resolved cards]</strong> to each of up to <strong>two</strong> different enemies you can see that are present on the scene; the type of this damage is one of your choice among those matching the <strong>suits</strong> of the resolved cards.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr><tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                        <p><strong>Magic Pair</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                        <p>2 cards of the same value</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                        <p>Perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with a weapon you have equipped. If this attack deals damage, choose a <strong>suit</strong> among those of the resolved cards; all damage dealt by the attack becomes the type matching that suit.</p>\n                    </td>\n</tr></tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</details>",
